#: gamelogic.cc:180
#, kde-format
msgid "The once mighty empire of %1 has fallen in ruins."
msgstr "ចក្រ​ភព​ដ៏​ខ្លាំង​ពូកែ​ពី​មុន​នៃ​ %1 បាន​ដួល​រលំរលាយ​ ។"

#: gamelogic.cc:187
#, kde-format
msgid "The fallen empire of %1 has staggered back to life."
